  "goodToKnow": "Die Attacke is an attack, especially a verbal one, in sport, or in medicine: eine Herzattacke, eine Panikattacke. For military attacks German usually says der Angriff, the more common word. Attackieren means to attack. Zur Attacke blasen means to sound the attack, often used about politicians going on the offensive. The word came via French attaque. Plural: die Attacken."
